Z||000000||artherd||09-05-2001||07:53 PM||||Here it is!<P>All bolted up after notching the internal webing to clear the starter. <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/northstar1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/northstar2.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/northstar3.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/northstar4.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/cradle.jpg">  <P>Sorry for low quality, it's video :S) ben needs a nice Nikon D1 back.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">   <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"<p>[This message has been edited by artherd (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||3
