Z||000004||artherd||09-05-2001||09:42 PM||||Funny you should ask, this one actually!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/drop-cradle.jpg">  <P>I'm on a 'silver' kick with this car, heh.<BR>Seems Silver 88s are pretty rare (only ~200made)  This car is getting totally restored eventually, first step is the mechanicals!<P>ugly cradle repainted and looking like, well, more than the $10 in paint anyway   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Nothing's really been done to the tranny for stregenth (infact, some cutting of metal was nessicary, see will's pics for a better idea, there's a starter that pokes where some minor tranny metal is, so that's gotta go.)  I'm basically gonna replace a few seals, and throw some Redline MTL in there, and go for it!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Wolfhound:<BR><B>WOW! Ben, what Fiero will you put this in?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">   <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"<p>[This message has been edited by artherd (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||3
Z||000005||Philphine||09-05-2001||09:55 PM||||what are you using for motor mounts? what kind of computer solutions are you working out? hope it goes well.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Will||09-05-2001||10:34 PM||||'Jyou polish that trans?<P>Going to do anything about the last trans bolt?<P>I noticed that the block I made to deal with it interfered with the stock exhaust cross-under pipe.<P>Good luck.||||reg||1
Z||000007||artherd||09-05-2001||11:36 PM||||Hey Will, no polish, it's actually paint belive it or not  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Duplicolor high-heat (the 'you wish ceramic 1200' degree stuff, heh.) Aluminum (colour).  Any auto-store should have it in rattle-cans, about $5ea.<P>I will probally do the whole bay in it, as far as paints go it's some of the best stuff I've ever found, adheres to almost anything, and is very resistant to just about everything.<P>Not sure what to do about that last bolt as of yet, I noticed similar interfearance a while ago.  I might either notch the crosover tube a tad (hrm) and/or build a bracket like yours, only a bit smaller (this is starting to become moot, as a really thin aluminum bracket won't really do much  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> However, the load is tension, not pressure, so maybe I will get away with smaller metal.  Or I may decide to just 'not worry about it'<P>Still lots to be done, not the least of which is the clutch/flywheel pack (not installed)<BR>and I need a coolant crosover tube, a throttle body, and prolly new exhaust manifolds too (mine are mangled)<P>But it's cool to see it bolt right up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Time to drop into the garage again and drool for a while. (then go back and make some $ to pay for the rest of it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>To answer the other questions, I am going with this engine computer from: <A HREF="http://www.chrfab.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.chrfab.com</A> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.chrfab.com/images/CHRF%20Images/MVC-866S.JPG"> <P>it comes with a custom wiring harness that is already setup to use every stock sensor on the Northstar's block!  Still not here yet, I'll post more once I get it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Will:<BR><B>'Jyou polish that trans?<P>Going to do anything about the last trans bolt?<P>I noticed that the block I made to deal with it interfered with the stock exhaust cross-under pipe.<P>Good luck.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000008||KissMySSFiero||09-06-2001||07:53 AM||||sweet<BR>keep us posted.  when are you getting  your clutch?<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
